  "description": "The term 'drugged man' refers to a person who has been rendered vulnerable through the use of drugs, often implying a loss of consciousness or impaired judgment. The meme uses this term to describe a victim of sexual violence, which is a real-world concept that requires understanding of the legal and social implications of drug-facilitated assault.",
